sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant User as Browser
  participant API as Backend
  participant DB as MongoDB
  participant CA as Platform CA
  participant Peer as Platform peer

  User->>API: Register credentials
  API->>DB: Create application user
  API->>CA: Register user-{UUID}
  CA-->>API: Enrollment secret
  API->>API: Generate private key and enrollment CSR
  API->>CA: Enroll user with CSR
  CA-->>API: Signed enrollment certificate
  Note right of API: Private key stays with the enrollment client. Store key and certificate in protected storage
  API->>DB: Save enrollment ID, MSP, status
  API->>Peer: CreateUser(userId, enrollmentId)
  Peer-->>API: User record (identity only, no balance)
